{"text":"You sit in the mud. And there, in the bank next to your ruin, a tiny new hole. Pip followed you to the river. His hole is tiny. And it doesn't collapse. Because Pip doesn't dig a cave. Pip digs a tunnel exactly as wide as Pip, and one small nest at the end. So you stop digging a cave. You dig a tunnel exactly as wide as your shoulders. A quarter of the dirt. Four times as fast. And you shape the roof into an arch, because an arch pushes the weight into the walls instead of down on you. The entrance faces north, away from where the asteroid will hit. Maybe it makes no difference. It feels right. Stay small. Even when you dig.","alignment":{"characters":["Y","o","u"," ","s","i","t"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","u","d","."," ","A","n","d"," ","t","h","e","r","e",","," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k"," ","n","e","x","t"," ","t","o"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","r","u","i","n",","," ","a"," ","t","i","n","y"," ","n","e","w"," ","h","o","l","e","."," ","P","i","p"," ","f","o","l","l","o","w","e","d"," ","y","o","u"," ","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r","."," ","H","i","s"," ","h","o","l","e"," ","i","s"," ","t","i","n","y","."," ","A","n","d"," ","i","t"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","c","o","l","l","a","p","s","e","."," ","B","e","c","a","u","s","e"," ","P","i","p"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","d","i","g"," ","a"," ","c","a","v","e","."," ","P","i","p"," ","d","i","g","s"," ","a"," ","t","u","n","n","e","l"," ","e","x","a","c","t","l","y"," ","a","s"," ","w","i","d","e"," ","a","s"," ","P","i","p",","," ","a","n","d"," ","o","n","e"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","n","e","s","t"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","n","d","."," ","S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","t","o","p"," ","d","i","g","g","i","n","g"," ","a"," ","c","a","v","e","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","i","g"," ","a"," ","t","u","n","n","e","l"," ","e","x","a","c","t","l","y"," ","a","s"," ","w","i","d","e"," ","a","s"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","s","h","o","u","l","d